00:03:00.172 --> 00:03:04.952
the text would enlarge the American military presence, including permission for a Golden

00:03:04.952 --> 00:03:06.432
Dome missile defense system.

00:03:06.992 --> 00:03:08.732
One desk states a finished vote.

00:03:08.732 --> 00:03:13.312
The other still has it ahead, and is the one that names the Missile Defense Permission.

