00:03:54.764 --> 00:03:59.024
More than 730,000, mostly Muslim, left in that crackdown.

00:03:59.544 --> 00:04:04.464
The Hindu, covering the same sitting, still described the ruling as ongoing while reporting

00:04:04.464 --> 00:04:08.324
killing, rape, violence against children and destroyed villages.

00:04:08.924 --> 00:04:13.624
The Gambia brought the case in 2019 under the 1948 genocide convention.

00:04:14.164 --> 00:04:18.984
The treaty that defines genocide and obliges states to prevent and punish it, and asked

00:04:18.984 --> 00:04:22.384
for illegal acts to stop and for those responsible to be punished.

00:04:23.144 --> 00:04:28.064
Mayan Mar has said the operation's answer to tax on police posts by the Arakhan Rohingya

00:04:28.064 --> 00:04:28.964
Salvation Army.

00:04:28.964 --> 00:04:35.224
The New York Times noted that on-song suki addressed the judges in 2019 and did not condemn

00:04:35.224 --> 00:04:36.184
the pogroms.

00:04:36.544 --> 00:04:41.604
The UN counts more than 1.3 million Rohingya still displaced across South and Southeast

00:04:41.604 --> 00:04:48.044
Asia, including 1.2 million in the camps at Cox's Bazaar, with age shrinking and sea crossing

00:04:48.044 --> 00:04:48.944
