00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:55.450
Venezuela's interim government and the U.S. Defense Secretary have a new military agreement, and

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:56.750
the public text is missing.

00:04:56.750 --> 00:05:02.810
Al Jazeera reported that Pete Hegseth announced it on an unannounced visit to Caracas on Wednesday,

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:08.610
after meeting interim president Delsey Rodriguez and defense minister Gustavo González Lopez.

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:14.290
The deal covers joint training, shared intelligence, military equipment, and border security.

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:18.990
Hegseth said the forces would go after drug trafficking and armed groups together.

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:23.730
Rodriguez called the visit extraordinary and said her forces would get better training,

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:27.690
Newer equipment and new technology without giving up sovereignty.

00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:31.530
How joint operations would actually run has not been published.

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:34.010
The administration's reason is practical.

00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:38.470
Help Caracas retake ground held by armed groups and trafficking networks.

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:44.390
Since U.S. forces seized then-President Nicholas Maduro and flew him to New York, Washington

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:49.450
has in effect taken charge of Venezuela's oil industry, and the country holds the world's

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:50.270
largest reserves.

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:56.130
On November 10, the House voted 211 to 204 against impeaching Hegseth for

00:05:56.130 --> 00:06:01.610
now. Republican Thomas Massey had offered eight articles, including the U.S.-Israel war

00:06:01.610 --> 00:06:07.030
on Iran, strikes on suspected drug boats, and the January operation that removed Maduro.

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:12.930
Massey said that operation was an act of war without Congress, aimed at the oil, not only

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:18.770
a trafficking arrest. The split sits on the unpublished pages. Hegseth and Rodriguez describe

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:24.010
a security partnership that modernizes Venezuela's armed forces and leaves sovereignty intact.

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:30.170
Analyst Carlos Pina reads the timing instead, Democrats won the November 3rd midterms and

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:35.370
have promised harder scrutiny of the 2026 deals with Caracas, and the impeachment vote

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:38.650
already failed, so the trip gets ahead of the next Congress.

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:44.070
Massey's charge is about that earlier operation, and his own resolution lost the vote.

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:49.190
Until the clauses are public, neither the sovereignty promised nor the oil motive can be checked

00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:50.250
against the document.

00:06:51.136 --> 00:06:56.316
