00:07:39.808 --> 00:07:47.468
Official figures show output fell 10.1% year on year from March 21 to June 20, the first quarter

00:07:47.468 --> 00:07:53.228
of the Persian calendar. Economist Payman Mollavi said that if this holds, growth in the money

00:07:53.228 --> 00:08:00.748
supply could move from nearly 51% to between 55% and 60% by late March, an annual inflation could

00:08:00.748 --> 00:08:07.868
